			1 BitsPerComponent 8 idiv{DataSource/read cvx/not cvx{0}/if cvx/mul cvx}repeat/mul cvx/add cvx
			}for
		/convProc load/exec cvx
		origcolorSpaceElemCnt 1 sub -1 0
			{
